<title>USA: Sharon Real Estate to buy ProTeam.</title>
<headline>Sharon Real Estate to buy ProTeam.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sharon Real Estate Consultants Inc said it had signed a letter of intent to acquire ProTeam International Inc of San Diego, California.</p>
<p>Sharon said in a statement ProTeam will receive 6.0 million shares of its common stock in exchange for all of the stock of ProTeam.</p>
<p>ProTeam will become a wholly-owned subsidiary of Sharon, it added.</p>
<p>ProTeam makes soft drinks &quot;Spalding Sports Refresher&quot; and &quot;Spalding for Kids&quot; under a license from the Spalding Corp through ProTeam's subsidiary, ProTeam Beverage Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
